2019s communication issues are minor or can be mitigated; strong positive data showing B\u2019s or D\u2019s crew cooperation and leadership outweigh their current drawbacks; or any new information indicating a critical safety\u2011related weakness in C.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}", "thoughts": "We need to produce final answer as agent_1, round 2. We have to consider any new info. The only new info is that agent_2 asked agent_1 for additional strengths/weaknesses and got none. So no new info. Also we have other agents' votes: agent_2 and agent_3 both favor Candidate C. So we likely maintain Candidate C. Provide public message summarizing key evidence, evidence from others, major alternatives, main tradeoff, remaining uncertainty, what would change vote. Then metadata with vote \"Candidate C\". Ensure format exactly.\n\nWe must not invent attributes. Use only given attributes. Provide confidence maybe moderate.\n\nProceed."}
